Dyalog Kafka interface v0.1.117 (2025-07-10), https://github.com/Dyalog/kafka
aplsource/: the APL source at tag v0.1.117 (samples omitted), with one
cosmetic patch: {} added in front of five statements so their results
aren't printed in an interactive session (the "0 0 0 0" noise):
  kafka/NA.aplf      ⎕NA¨z               →  {}⎕NA¨z
  Consumer.aplc (×2) configure¨↓config   →  {}configure¨↓config
  Consumer.aplc      set_topic_partition¨…  →  {}set_topic_partition¨…  (in subscribe)
  Producer.aplc      configure¨↓config   →  {}configure¨↓config
Reapply these when upgrading.
The Linux shared libraries (kafka.so, librdkafka.so) are not stored here:
the Dockerfile downloads the v0.1.117 release and checks its SHA-256.
